,"interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line011:m0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"任覽","kind":"person","person_id":"u08_qcx_vq1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line011:m0133","start":133,"end":134,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line011:m0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"諷","kind":"person","person_id":"vhp_i3i_jj4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line011:m0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"覽","kind":"person","person_id":"u08_qcx_vq1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line011:m0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"諷","kind":"person","person_id":"vhp_i3i_jj4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":11,"last_line":11,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　鄭袤，字林叔，滎陽開封人也。高祖眾，漢大司農。父泰，揚州刺史，有高名。袤少孤，早有識鑒。荀攸見之曰：「鄭公業為不亡矣。」隨叔父渾避難江東。時華歆為豫章太守，渾往依之，歆素與泰善，撫養袤如己子。年十七，乃還鄉里。性清正。時濟陰魏諷為相國掾，名重當世，袤同郡任覽與結交。袤以諷奸雄，終必為禍，勸覽遠之。及諷敗，論者稱焉。","raw_start":378,"raw_end":538,"raw_line":11},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-zhengmao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013","text":"魏武帝初封諸子為侯，精選賓友，袤與徐幹俱為臨淄侯文學，轉司隸功曹從事。司空王朗辟為掾，袤舉高陽許允、扶風魯芝、東萊王基，朗皆命之，後咸至大位，有重名。袤遷尚書郎。出為黎陽令，吏民悅服。太守班下屬城，特見甄異，為諸縣之最。遷尚書右丞。轉濟陰太守，下車旌表孝悌，敬禮賢能，興立庠序，開誘後進。調補大將軍從事中郎，拜散騎常侍。會廣平太守缺，宣帝謂袤曰：「賢叔大匠垂稱于陽平、魏郡，百姓蒙惠化。且盧子家、王子雍繼踵此郡，使世不乏賢，故復相屈。」袤在廣平，以德化為先，善作條教，郡中愛之。徵拜侍中，百姓戀慕，涕泣路隅。遷少府。高貴鄉公即位，袤與河南尹王肅備法駕奉迎於元城，封廣昌亭侯。徙光祿勳，領宗正。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"魏武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"徐幹","kind":"person","person_id":"6cf_d80_a57","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"臨淄侯","kind":"person","person_id":"p6s_2qn_p8n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"王朗","kind":"person","person_id":"d21_081_910","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"許允","kind":"person","person_id":"s0c_yo6_6gq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"魯芝","kind":"person","person_id":"p2q_m63_1jq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"王基","kind":"person","person_id":"7f4_2d4_c15","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"d21_081_910","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0170","start":170,"end":171,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0194","start":194,"end":197,"surface":"盧子家","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0198","start":198,"end":201,"surface":"王子雍","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0218","start":218,"end":219,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0258","start":258,"end":262,"surface":"高貴鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"d6b_ea7_928","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0265","start":265,"end":266,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line013:m0270","start":270,"end":272,"surface":"王肅","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":13,"last_line":13,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　魏武帝初封諸子為侯，精選賓友，袤與徐幹俱為臨淄侯文學，轉司隸功曹從事。司空王朗辟為掾，袤舉高陽許允、扶風魯芝、東萊王基，朗皆命之，後咸至大位，有重名。袤遷尚書郎。出為黎陽令，吏民悅服。太守班下屬城，特見甄異，為諸縣之最。遷尚書右丞。轉濟陰太守，下車旌表孝悌，敬禮賢能，興立庠序，開誘後進。調補大將軍從事中郎，拜散騎常侍。會廣平太守缺，宣帝謂袤曰：「賢叔大匠垂稱于陽平、魏郡，百姓蒙惠化。且盧子家、王子雍繼踵此郡，使世不乏賢，故復相屈。」袤在廣平，以德化為先，善作條教，郡中愛之。徵拜侍中，百姓戀慕，涕泣路隅。遷少府。高貴鄉公即位，袤與河南尹王肅備法駕奉迎於元城，封廣昌亭侯。徙光祿勳，領宗正。","raw_start":540,"raw_end":838,"raw_line":13},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_